<panel>
  <div name="tut-root" background-color="#000a15" border-radius="20" padding="20" width="400" flex-direction="column" align-items="center" gap="8">
    <div name="tut-title" font-size="22" color="#00ffff" font-weight="bold">HOW TO PLAY</div>
    <div name="tut-body" flex-direction="column" gap="6" width="360">
      <div name="t1" font-size="13" color="#cccccc">Climb to the top to rescue!</div>
      <div name="t2" font-size="13" color="#cccccc">Avoid or jump over barrels.</div>
      <div name="t3" font-size="13" color="#cccccc">Grab hammers to smash barrels.</div>
      <div name="t3b" font-size="13" color="#4488ff">Collect shields to block hits!</div>
      <div name="t3c" font-size="13" color="#ff6600">Watch for fire barrels and springs!</div>
      <div name="t3d" font-size="13" color="#00ff88">Grab neon gems for bonus points!</div>
      <div name="t3e" font-size="13" color="#ff2200">Beware ladder patrols (level 6+)!</div>
      <div name="t3f" font-size="13" color="#ffff00">Lightning bolts give speed boosts!</div>
      <div name="t3g" font-size="13" color="#ffaa00">Conveyor belts push you (level 5+)!</div>
      <div name="t3h" font-size="13" color="#88ccff">Collect rivets for big bonus points!</div>
      <div name="t3i" font-size="13" color="#ff44ff">Warp portals teleport you (level 4+)!</div>
      <div name="t3j" font-size="13" color="#ff3366">Hearts give an extra life (rare)!</div>
      <div name="t3k" font-size="13" color="#ff8844">Orange platforms crumble (level 7+)!</div>
      <div name="spacer" height="4"></div>
      <div name="t4" font-size="14" color="#ffaa00">Keyboard Controls:</div>
      <div name="t5" font-size="12" color="#888888">Arrows/WASD - Move and Climb</div>
      <div name="t6" font-size="12" color="#888888">Space/F - Jump</div>
      <div name="t7" font-size="12" color="#888888">Esc/P - Pause</div>
      <div name="spacer2" height="4"></div>
      <div name="t8" font-size="14" color="#ffaa00">VR Controls:</div>
      <div name="t9" font-size="12" color="#888888">Thumbstick - Move and Climb</div>
      <div name="t10" font-size="12" color="#888888">Trigger/A - Jump</div>
      <div name="t11" font-size="12" color="#888888">B - Pause</div>
      <div name="spacer3" height="4"></div>
      <div name="t12" font-size="14" color="#ffaa00">Game Modes:</div>
      <div name="t13" font-size="12" color="#888888">Arcade - Classic play with 3 lives</div>
      <div name="t14" font-size="12" color="#888888">Speed - Clear levels in 120 seconds</div>
      <div name="t15" font-size="12" color="#888888">Zen - 99 lives, relax and climb</div>
      <div name="t16" font-size="12" color="#888888">Challenge - Only 200 moves</div>
    </div>
    <div name="btn-tut-back" font-size="14" color="#888888" hover-opacity="0.7">Back</div>
  </div>
</panel>
